<title>USA: IPO FILING-Triton Systems Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Triton Systems Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Triton Systems Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			TRTN.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-$13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    4.2 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.75 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  450,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    16,158,288</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  630,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: The Long Beach, Ms., based company is a manufacturer and marketer of automated teller machines (ATMs) in the United States.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay bank indebtedness, for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
